    </div>




                        
                            
    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <p><strong>Ticket Prices:</strong><br>Please check individual performances for price availability*</p>
    </div>
    

                        
                            

<div class="bard-content bard-box light-grey">
    
    <p><strong>Age Recommendation:</strong> 14+</p><p>Everyone, regardless of age, must have their own ticket to enter the theatre. Children under the age of 16 must be accompanied by, and seated next to, a ticketholder who is at least 18 years old. Children under the age of 3 will not be admitted.</p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Please note:</span></strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span>This production contains scenes of a sexual and violent nature, wartime themes, firearms, derogatory and coarse language, drug use and the simulated smoking of cigarettes. The production also contains strobe lighting, gun shots, loud sound effects, theatrical haze, and pyrotechnics.</p>
    
</div>



                        
                            
    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <p><strong>Performance Schedule</strong><br>Monday – Saturday: 7.30pm<br>Wednesday &amp; Saturday: 2.30pm</p><p><strong>Show Running Time:</strong> Approximately 2 hours and 40 minutes including an interval.</p>
    </div>
    

                        
                            

<div class="bard-content bard-box light-grey">
    
    <p>Latecomers may not be admitted until a suitable break, but we cannot guarantee admittance into the performance.<br>If you need to leave your seat during the performance, you may be asked to wait until a suitable moment before re-entering the auditorium. This is to minimise disturbance both to other audience members and the performers on stage.<br><strong>Please note that you may not bring food or drink purchased elsewhere into our theatres.</strong><br>The producers may make alterations to the published cast for any reason, at any time, and therefore cannot guarantee the appearance of any named artist.<br>Filming, photography and phone use are not permitted during the performance.<br>For full terms and conditions, please <a href="/terms-and-conditions"><u>click here</u></a>.</p>
    
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

            
                
                
                
                
