    <div class="bard-content !mb-0">
        
        <p>To find out about access at Delfont Mackintosh Theatres, including how to book, assisted listening and wheelchair access, visit our <a href="/access"><u>Access Hub</u></a><u>.</u></p><p>Information regarding accessibility at the Prince Edward Theatre can be found <a href="/theatres/prince-edward-theatre#access">here</a>.</p>
